<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Happy Monthsary ❤️</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 50px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3em;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-weight: normal;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .message {
      font-size: 1.2em;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .heart {
      font-size: 50px;
      animation: beat 1s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes beat {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }

    button {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background-color: #fff;
      color: #ff6f91;
      font-size: 1em;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover {
      background-color: #ffe0e6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>
    <h1>Happy Monthsary!</h1>
    <h2>March 23</h2>

    <p class="message">
  1st month with you, but it feels like forever. I've known you since 2024, yet you’ve never changed.
  Thank you for giving me the chance to prove my love for you, and of course, for loving me unconditionally.
  I'm so happy with everything that's happening to us, sev—from introducing you to my family and friends, to finally being your girlfriend.
  <br><br>
  I love everything about you—your smile, your scent, your body ;), your mindset. I love you for being you, baby.
  <br><br>
  Baby, I promise that I’ll wait until we see each other again and until the day we finally get to live together in one house.
  I’ll make bawi when we meet again, baby, but for now, this website muna is my gift for you hehe.
  <br><br>
  I miss you so much, baby. Sana talaga ikasal na tayo.
  I’m always here for you, baby, kahit 3,000 miles ang layo mo. Always remember that you have a girlfriend named Audrey Eunice Manero—soon to be yours. 💖
  <br><br>
  I love you so much, baby ko!
</p>

    <button onclick="showMessage()">Click me 💌</button>
  </div>

  <script>
    function showMessage() {
      alert("You are my favorite person, no matter the distance ❤️");
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
